check_gmm_refusals OK [FAST]: 15 refusals by name (3 covariance types, 3 init_params, 3 non-finite, 2 n_components, tol, reg_covar, a collapsed component citing DEVIATION 1723 with its component and info); 'full', 'kmeans', 'random' and the same collapse fixture at reg_covar=1e-6 all ACCEPTED, so the refusals are not always firing
