check_iteration_count_is_identical OK [FAST]: 5 fixtures, two fits each from one seed, agreeing on the ITERATION COUNT, the convergence flag, the lower bound's BITS and every parameter cell; SEPARATED=2c OVERLAP=2c DUPLICATES=2c ONE_D=2c SIGNED_ZERO=2c (c = converged, x = ran out). The count is emitted as gmm.niter = [n_iter, converged, max_iter]
